---
description: WhipScribe Buildathon — project brief and rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Read AGENTS.md at the repository root before starting; it is the brief and the rules.
- Own account only; never someone else's audio, transcript or key.
- No secrets in the repo; keys and OAuth secrets live in ignored local config.
- Do not invent API behaviour: use https://whipscribe.com/docs or a real response.
- Small PRs; commit messages name the change; READMEs say what is unfinished.
- Track 2 and 3 code lives in apps/<your-name>/ with its own README.
